			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4474913">
									

<p>Glad to see this got posted.</p>
<p>All in all, I really like this. As someone who is warry of the &quot;rinse and repeat&quot; style of offsets, the changes between iterations are drastic enough that treading over the old ground is not dull. Additionally, the mystery of what the room's deal is that gets slowly unraveled across the various iterations I found to be quite compelling.</p>
<p>If I did have one complaint, its that we have seen the &quot;We've done this before&quot; story thread a few times on the SCP wiki already (most notably in SCP-2000), though your take here isn't bad by any stretch.</p>
<p>+1 Mann. A good addition to the contest.</p>

